      <span class="hidden md:inline text-slate-400">平均链路延迟: <span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono">34ms</span></span>
      <span class="hidden lg:inline text-slate-600">|</span>
      <span class="hidden lg:inline text-amber-300/90 font-medium">🛡️ 消费安全提醒：坚持月付优先，规避跑路风险</span>
    </div>
    
    <div class="hidden sm:flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-400 font-mono text-[11px] shrink-0">
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
        SS2022 / Reality
